WEBVTT

00:31:29.746 --> 00:31:32.496
You know, your mind is continually

00:31:33.746 --> 00:31:37.454
wants to expand and grow. And I've
been really lucky in that way.

00:31:38.371 --> 00:31:43.163
And then, you know, you're also going
back to this chimp human thing,

00:31:43.163 --> 00:31:48.204
and you touched upon it already, but what
?

00:31:48.746 --> 00:31:53.871
Because we're so like them, more like
them than any other living creature,

00:31:54.496 --> 00:31:56.913
it helps you understand
how we're different.

00:31:57.746 --> 00:32:01.246
And I think the main difference is